```javascript
const updateMNPStatus = (index, mnpStatus) => {
  const newRegistrations = [...this.state.registrations];
  newRegistrations[index].mnpStatus = mnpStatus;
  this.setState({ registrations: newRegistrations });
};
```

2. Call the `updateMNPStatus` function inside the `checkMNPStatusAPI` when you receive the response from the API.

```javascript
